From e9dda5bbd37ecc614d06778b6e08fc8c59208032 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christophe Marin <christophe@krop.fr>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:07:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Bump soversion for each release

This is a modified version of https://invent.kde.org/libraries/ktextaddons/-/merge_requests/63

ktextaddons doesn't have binary compatibility guarantees and already broke our packages.
These changes will force a rebuild of dependent packages after every release.
